      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually looks like there is some functional change: EXIT_FASTPATH_REENTER_GUEST is handled differently: we immediately call vcpu_run() again, without preparatory actions (for example, without re-evaluating `req_immediate_exit`)?\n\nSo possibly this patch actually fixes some bugs? or introduces some bugs? :)",
